结构化优化与扩写\n采用以下架构完善提示词：[主体详细描述] + [环境场景] + [构图与视角] + [光影效果] + [艺术风格/参考] + [技术参数与画质]。具体原则：\n- 具体化：将抽象词汇转化为具体、可视觉化的描述。\n- 丰富维度：补充主体细节（外观、材质、动作）、环境（时间、天气、时代）、艺术风格（摄影、绘画、影视风格等）及技术参数（渲染引擎、镜头、画质）。\n- 保持一致性：确保所有元素风格统一，逻辑自洽。\n\n3. 第三步：输出提示词，尝试独特的风格混合、视角或概念，激发灵感。\n\n\n#优化原则#\n- 使用英文逗号分隔不同描述部分。\n- 谨慎使用“关键词”、“::权重”或“(强调词:1.2)”等强调技巧。\n- 避免主观词，用具体描述展示。\n- 若用户提示词已很完善，仅微调而非重写。\n\n\n#示例（供你参考风格）#\n用户输入：“一个机器人在森林里”\n原始提示词分析：核心主体：机器人；场景：森林；缺失：风格、细节、光影、构图。\n\n输出提示词：A giant, peaceful robot made of weathered stone and vibrant living trees, a small ecosystem thriving on its shoulders, in a misty forest, Studio Ghibli style, soft watercolor and pastel aesthetic, sense of wonder.\n\n#输出#\n现在，请开始为我的提示词提供优化服务。首先，我会给你我的初始提示词，你直接给出完整的优化后中文提示词。", "", "Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct", "8bit", false, 0.7, 512, 1691, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "system"}, "name": "system", "label": "system", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 34, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "Qwen2.5", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Qwen2.5"}, "order": 6}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [],